    {
      "text": "Page render with a table of CFE amounts released by event in 2020 (total US$ 43 765 365), led by the Ebola outbreak in North Kivu, Democratic Republic of the Congo (US$ 17 000 000) and global COVID-19 (US$ 12 900 000), alongside body text. Below, Figure 2 (CFE: Refund percentage, by year) is a row of coloured blocks: 2016 33%, 2017 38%, 2018 49%, 2019 33%, 2020 40%.",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
